      "message": "The `coset::Result` returned here does not include a `context` extension like `anyhow`. Actually this library is used in both the std (host) and nostd (service VM) environments for converting between bytes and structs. While it\u0027s possible to change the return to `anyhow::Result` in std, it would pose a problem in nostd as we do not support anyhow errors there yet (errors in nostd [1][2]).\n\n[1] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/rialto/src/error.rs;l\u003d32;drc\u003dd80e99e2a8bfe9fb12beac38f00f229074c613b4\n[2] https://cs.android.com/android/platform/superproject/main/+/main:packages/modules/Virtualization/service_vm/comm/src/message.rs;l\u003d75;drc\u003d881d14eda1542640493c3eb58920c10b11a52713",
